/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 309 0 R
/T (Project Harit Samriddhi is an integrated sustainable agriculture program implemented in Tandwa and Simariya blocks of Chatra district, Jharkhand. The initiative focuses on natural resource conservation, farmer capacity building, crop diversification, and income enhancement through demonstration-based learning and certified training. It creates climate-resilient rural livelihoods by combining water-efficient practices, soil health management, and market-oriented interventions.)
/E (Project Harit Samriddhi is an integrated sustainable agriculture program implemented in Tandwa and Simariya blocks of Chatra district, Jharkhand. The initiative focuses on natural resource conservation, farmer capacity building, crop diversification, and income enhancement through demonstration-based learning and certified training. It creates climate-resilient rural livelihoods by combining water-efficient practices, soil health management, and market-oriented interventions.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [8]
>>
