773 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 310 0 R
/T (Pushpa Kumari: A Catalyst for Change Pushpa Kumari, a smallholder farmer from Dadi village, struggled with declining yields and high fertiliser costs. After attending Harit Samriddhi training, she adopted crop rotation and integrated pest management. Within a single season, her soil health improved, fertiliser use dropped by 25%, and yields rose noticeably. Seeing her success, five other women farmers in the village adopted similar practices, collectively covering 15 acres under improved methods. Pushpa now leads farmer meetings as a peer educator, symbolising the ripple effect of knowledge-sharing that Project Harit Samriddhi aims to create.)
/E (Pushpa Kumari: A Catalyst for Change Pushpa Kumari, a smallholder farmer from Dadi village, struggled with declining yields and high fertiliser costs. After attending Harit Samriddhi training, she adopted crop rotation and integrated pest management. Within a single season, her soil health improved, fertiliser use dropped by 25%, and yields rose noticeably. Seeing her success, five other women farmers in the village adopted similar practices, collectively covering 15 acres under improved methods. Pushpa now leads farmer meetings as a peer educator, symbolising the ripple effect of knowledge-sharing that Project Harit Samriddhi aims to create.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
