/T (Project Samriddhi is a Crop Residue Management \(CRM\) initiative in Jind district of Haryana aimed at reducing stubble burning and empowering SHGs to create handicrafts from paddy residue. The project reduces stubble burning by linking farmers to service providers, promoting in-situ and ex-situ solutions, and empowering Self-Help Groups \(SHGs\) to convert parali \(paddy residue\) into marketable handicrafts. It integrates awareness campaigns, skill-building, and market linkage creation to transform parali from waste into wealth.)
/E (Project Samriddhi is a Crop Residue Management \(CRM\) initiative in Jind district of Haryana aimed at reducing stubble burning and empowering SHGs to create handicrafts from paddy residue. The project reduces stubble burning by linking farmers to service providers, promoting in-situ and ex-situ solutions, and empowering Self-Help Groups \(SHGs\) to convert parali \(paddy residue\) into marketable handicrafts. It integrates awareness campaigns, skill-building, and market linkage creation to transform parali from waste into wealth.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [10]
>>
