<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 313 0 R
/E (Project Bhoomi is a flagship climate-smart agriculture initiative under the K.K. Birla Memorial Society CSR program, implemented across Fatehabad, Jind, Sonipat, and Hisar districts of Haryana. The program aims to eliminate crop residue burning through a holistic approach combining farmer sensitisation, crop diversification, Direct Seeding of Rice \(DSR\) promotion, and farm mechanisation support. By creating strong linkages with service providers and end-user industries, Project Bhoomi builds a self-sustaining ecosystem that benefits farmers economically while improving air quality and soil health.)
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
