885 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 315 0 R
/T (Harit Dhara Saaf Vayu is a multi-year CSR initiative supported by NatWest, implemented across 60 villages in Jind district, Haryana. The program aims to drastically reduce stubble burning, improve air quality, and promote climate-smart agriculture practices such as Crop Residue Management \(CRM\) and Direct Seeding of Rice \(DSR\). By combining machine access, input support, farmer sensitisation, and continuous monitoring through the Roots Agri App, the project creates a replicable model for sustainable farming)
/E (Harit Dhara Saaf Vayu is a multi-year CSR initiative supported by NatWest, implemented across 60 villages in Jind district, Haryana. The program aims to drastically reduce stubble burning, improve air quality, and promote climate-smart agriculture practices such as Crop Residue Management \(CRM\) and Direct Seeding of Rice \(DSR\). By combining machine access, input support, farmer sensitisation, and continuous monitoring through the Roots Agri App, the project creates a replicable model for sustainable farming)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
