929 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 316 0 R
/T (Kuldeep Singh, a farmer from Bighana village \(Alewa block\), had to burn stubble last year due to lack of baler operators. Under Project Harit Dhara, he accessed baling services for his 23 acres, preventing residue burning entirely. This inspired him to advocate CRM practices to neighboring farmers. The following season, a cluster of nearby villages reported a dramatic drop in farm fires, showing how access to solutions and peer advocacy can accelerate community-wide adoption.)
/E (Kuldeep Singh, a farmer from Bighana village \(Alewa block\), had to burn stubble last year due to lack of baler operators. Under Project Harit Dhara, he accessed baling services for his 23 acres, preventing residue burning entirely. This inspired him to advocate CRM practices to neighboring farmers. The following season, a cluster of nearby villages reported a dramatic drop in farm fires, showing how access to solutions and peer advocacy can accelerate community-wide adoption.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [20]
>>
endobj
