/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 317 0 R
/T (The Escorts Kubota Limited \(EKL\) Basic & Advanced Training Program is designed to build farmer capacity through structured classroom training and practical, on-field demonstrations. Conducted at the Escorts Kubota Advanced Farming Institute \(EKAFI\) in Kurukshetra and extended to Ambala, Kaithal, Yamunanagar \(Haryana\) and Mandya \(Karnataka\), the program provides farmers with comprehensive knowledge on crop diversification, mechanisation, soil health, animal husbandry, and sustainable practices. The initiative empowers farmers to adopt modern, profitable, and climate-resilient agriculture techniques.)
/E (The Escorts Kubota Limited \(EKL\) Basic & Advanced Training Program is designed to build farmer capacity through structured classroom training and practical, on-field demonstrations. Conducted at the Escorts Kubota Advanced Farming Institute \(EKAFI\) in Kurukshetra and extended to Ambala, Kaithal, Yamunanagar \(Haryana\) and Mandya \(Karnataka\), the program provides farmers with comprehensive knowledge on crop diversification, mechanisation, soil health, animal husbandry, and sustainable practices. The initiative empowers farmers to adopt modern, profitable, and climate-resilient agriculture techniques.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [2]
