1047 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 322 0 R
/T (Launched in October 2024 in partnership with the BC Jindal Foundation, VCL was designed as a four-month intervention that combined football and kabaddi tournaments with life skills education and financial incentives. Students from Classes 7 and 8 in two villages, Kaimri and Mangali, participated in the league, which not only kept them in classrooms but also equipped them with essential skills in teamwork, financial literacy, and communication. By rewarding performance with cash prizes and linking incentives to school attendance, the project addressed both educational and economic barriers faced by families.)
/E (Launched in October 2024 in partnership with the BC Jindal Foundation, VCL was designed as a four-month intervention that combined football and kabaddi tournaments with life skills education and financial incentives. Students from Classes 7 and 8 in two villages, Kaimri and Mangali, participated in the league, which not only kept them in classrooms but also equipped them with essential skills in teamwork, financial literacy, and communication. By rewarding performance with cash prizes and linking incentives to school attendance, the project addressed both educational and economic barriers faced by families.)
/Pg 43 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
