/S /H3
/P 3130 0 R
/T (Government High School, Satiye Wala \(Punjab\):  Before Sports Lab, students here rarely played sports. With a dedicated handball coach and proper facilities introduced, participation surged. Within a year, seven students qualified for district-level tournaments, and by 2024, the school secured medals at state events. The pride of the school and village grew, and the sports department officially established a handball unit.)
/E (Government High School, Satiye Wala \(Punjab\):  Before Sports Lab, students here rarely played sports. With a dedicated handball coach and proper facilities introduced, participation surged. Within a year, seven students qualified for district-level tournaments, and by 2024, the school secured medals at state events. The pride of the school and village grew, and the sports department officially established a handball unit.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
1237 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 3131 0 R
/T (Ladwa Village \(Haryana\): Sports Lab created a thriving handball culture in Ladwa by providing trainers and equipment. The Panchayat and local philanthropists, inspired by the program, developed a full-fledged sports ground and secured a sports nursery for the village. Many students now have access to job opportunities through sports, proving how community-driven efforts can sustain impact.)
/E (Ladwa Village \(Haryana\): Sports Lab created a thriving handball culture in Ladwa by providing trainers and equipment. The Panchayat and local philanthropists, inspired by the program, developed a full-fledged sports ground and secured a sports nursery for the village. Many students now have access to job opportunities through sports, proving how community-driven efforts can sustain impact.)
/Pg 50 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
